  "readmeFile": "docs/README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Patch notes for 152.0.138\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 151.0.100.\n\nAdded 16 new endpoints:\n* Me.RemoveMyAvatar\n* MeetingTag.ReplaceMeetingTags\n* MeetingTag.AddTagsToMeeting\n* MeetingTag.RemoveTagsFromMeeting\n* MeetingTag.RetrieveTagsForAMeeting\n* MeetingTodos.GetMeetingTodos\n* MeetingTodos.CreateMeetingTodos\n* MeetingTodos.UpdateAMeetingTodos\n* MeetingTodos.RemoveMeetingTodos\n* ProjectPriority.CreateProjectPriority\n* ProjectPriority.UpdateProjectPriority\n* ProjectPriority.DeleteProjectPriority\n* RiskTag.ReplaceRiskTags\n* RiskTag.AddTagsToRisk\n* RiskTag.RemoveTagsFromRisk\n* RiskTag.RetrieveTagsForARisk\n\nChanges to data models:\n* CountryDto: Added new field `countryId`\n* CountryDto: Added new field `cultureName`\n* HourlyRateDetailsDto: Removed field `isActive`\n* HourlyRateDto: Removed field `isActive`\n* ResourceCreateDto: Added new field `publicAvatarId`\n* ResourceUpdateDto: Added new field `publicAvatarId`\n* ResourceUpdateDto: Added new field `clearAvatar`\n* RiskCreateDto: Added new field `riskTypeId`\n* TaskFileDto: Added new field `createDate`\n* TaskFileDto: Added new field `fileType`\n* TaskFileDto: Added new field `fileTypeLabel`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `workSpaceCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `workSpaceCurrencyCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `userCulture`\n* WorkSpaceUserInfoDto: Added new field `userCurrencyCulture`\n\nDeprecated 1 old endpoints:\n* HourlyRate.UpdateHourlyRate",
